window.products.push({"id":700076,"name":"3CF Old Wood Southwest Aromatic Blend of Pinon and Juniper Heat-Treated Firewood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JBBnssjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A wonderful combination of aromatic firewood from the Southwest, USA. We have blended two of the Southwest's well-known woods - Pinon & Juniper, into a 3 cubic foot box that will provide warmth and fragrance for you, your family, and friends. The fragrance of Pinon & Juniper, especially when burned, is unmistakable. Pinon wood is a favorite of most chiminea, fireplace and stove owners, for it's pleasant \"pine aroma\", which helps to repel mosquitoes and other flying insects. It keeps an active flame, produces good heat, and burns well with other woods. The Juniper is also a great-smelling wood, and brings to mind a desert campfire in the Navajo Country. It crackles a fair bit but burns hot and with great colors too. Bugs seem to like the aromatic qualities of Juniper smoke even less than Pinon wood. All our boxed firewood is \"Heat-Treated\" according to USDA certification standards. Bugs are killed and much of the moisture in the wood is removed. Log lengths of 16\" are packed into an 18\" x 18\" x 18\" box that contains 3 cubic feet of firewood and weighs about 90 lbs. This is an \"all-natural\" product of New Mexico containing no additives of any kind and made proudly by our family business; shipped direct to your home or business anywhere in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JBBnssjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLD WOOD","source_asin":"B01N5BF6PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5BF6PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5BF6PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700077,"name":"Air Conditioner Portable for Room 3-in-1 Evaporative Coolers Mini Air Conditioner Humidifier with Built-in Battery Portable USB Table Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aJ5VjkHIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: ABS Product Size: 173*152*174mm Water Tank Capacity: 300ml Water Usage time: About 5-8 hrs(Depends on fan speed) Unit Weight: 875g Input Voltage: DC 5V (TYPE-C) BATTERY: 2000mah (LASTING 1.5~3 Hours) Charging Current: 1A Working power: 1W-8W Wind Speed: 1.57m/s~3.5m/s NOTE: 1. When charging, the red light on. when fully charged the blue color light on.  2. Short press the start button, the fan and spray start at the same time (the first fan is started by default), short press again to adjust the fan gear, click to increase one gear, and press the button when it reaches third gear, the fan and spray off. The three-color indicator shows the gear position, the first gear is red, the second gear is green, and the third gear is blue. the white light is the spray work indicator. 3. when air cooler start working, short press the spray button can turn off the spray. (①If the fan is not turned on, the spray cannot be turned on. ②Turn off the fan, the spray will also be turned off) 4. When the sensor board detects that there is no water, the spray stops working. 5. Short press the light button, RGB lights up, long press the light button to fix the color, and short press again to turn off the RGB. 7. if there is no external power supply, when the power is insufficient, the charging indicator flashes red quickly until the fan stops working and the red light goes out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aJ5VjkHIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TTD","source_asin":"B08D3Z579L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D3Z579L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D3Z579L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
