window.products.push({"id":700110,"name":"Polish Pottery Ceramika Boleslawiec 1022/280 1-1/4 by 6 1/8-Inch Spoon, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-89FoP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Unikat Signature Polish Pottery is a Limited production from a small factory near Boleslawiec, Poland. The Model 1022 Pattern 280 created using Boleslawiec White Clay molded and painted by hand according to Traditional Methods with Styles of Design and Color influenced by Contemporary shapes and dyes. The beautiful Spoon Medium has a Royal Blue edge and a 'Baron Girod de l'Ain' red rose. The exceptional rose is bright scarlet red with white edging to each petal tip. The rose accented by its lush leaves, tri-petal blossoms with scalloped leaves and clusters of blue buds dropping away from yellow and brown blossoms. The Spoon created with a unique original design and formation of the mold followed by drying, pre-baking at 1562-Degree Fahrenheit then Glazed, and fired at 2282-Degree Fahrenheit is Scratch and Chip resistant, Lead free, Oven; Microwave; Dishwasher and Freezer safe without losing the beautiful colors and textures. The measurements in-inch are-7/8 high by 6 long by 1-1/4 wide. *Note; No machines used for Molding or Pattern stamping therefore there may be small variations in measurements and Patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-89FoP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polish Pottery Ceramika Boleslawiec","source_asin":"B005XT37PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005XT37PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005XT37PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700111,"name":"ELTRICOLOR Cantaritos de Barro Jarritos Mexicanos - Set of 2 Authentic Mexican Glazed Clay Mugs 14 Oz For Drink Margaritas & Tequila Special For Mexic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e7ALXncmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ORIGINAL & AUTHENTIC DESING - Both classic & unique in design our mexican cantaritos allow us to continue with the beautiful & tasty mexican tradition of drink tequila, mezcal, micheladas & any cold drink preserving the classic & homey style with a high quality product & authentic desing your parties & events will be unique with this cantaritos & your guests will love them. HIGH QUALITY - Our Handmade Mexican Cantaritos de Barro are handcrafted by profesionals mexican artisans who are very commited with their work to have a high quality product, first they work with clay mud & engobe until it is well kneaded to after introduce the cantaritos to a high temperature baking process to have a strong and durable product. HIGH QUALITY - After that the cantaritos are glazed inside with a ceramic glaze to have a food-safe product (You won´t need to cure this cantaritos, this process makes them food safe and impermeable.) and at the end the cantaritos are decorated by the profesionals artisans to have a classic & unique product. DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE & FOOD SAFE - Our Mexicans Cantaritos are glazed inside with a ceramic glaze wich give us the security that you could drink warm & cold beverages & the best part is that you won´t need to cure this cantaritos thanks to the inside glazed process this make them safe to use, impermeable, easy to hold, durable, no spilling or tipping, reusable, microwavable & very easy to clean, it is perfect for consistent use. PERFECT FOR - Ideal to drink tequila, palomas, vodka, margaritas, gin, micheladas, tepache, ponche, pulque, sotol, mezcal, tejuino, agua de horchata, café de olla, pozol, coffe , tea, chocolate, champurrado, avena, atole, party decorations, gifts, mexican parties, home decorations, kitchen, housewarming, birthday, 5 de Mayo, 16 de Septiembre, Independencia de Mexico, taco tuesday, wedding, anniversary, graduation, christmas, thanksgiving, new years, mother's day, father's day & dia de muertos. PERFECT SIZE - The top diameter is 3'', the bottom diameter is 1.9'', and the height is 5''. Capacity is 14 ounces (14 Oz). Enough to enjoy your warm & cold drink. BE CARFUL WHEN YOU DRINK WARM BEVERAGES CANTARITO COULD BECOME HOT TO THE TOUCH WHEN FILLED WITH HOT BEVERAGES.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e7ALXncmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELTRICOLOR","source_asin":"B0B1BFYC18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1BFYC18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1BFYC18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
