window.products.push({"id":700140,"name":"Huusk Professional Chef Knife with Sharp Edge and French Full Tang Handle Fathers Carving Knife for Meat Knife for Home and Restaurant use Vegetables ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v9C7vGv1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Outstanding Design and Craftsmanship - The last knife you will ever need. Our professional chef knife uses ultra-tough carbon steel ATS-34 forged from a unified piece of rustproof metal. Our knives combine German knife technology and Japanese knife meticulous, the sharp edge is hand finished by expert bladesmiths using the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method. Fit for All Tasks: Expertly crafted with a tapered edge that cuts with ease and efficiency. The sharp and laser-tested blade effortlessly chops, minces, slices and dices. The curved blade is perfect for many kitchen tasks like trimming brisket, slicing meat, chopping vegetables, breaking down a whole chicken and deboning lamb ribs. Warm Tips: It is NOT dishwasher-safe and please keep it clean and dry after each use. It will last a long lifetime with reasonable maintenance. Ergonomic Wooden Handle - Ergonomic handle provides a comfortable and flexible grip. It can be used for both left and right-handed users. The integrated design handle, which is different from welding handle, will not break after long-term use. The ergonomic wooden handle with finger saddle can minimize the wrist tension. Let's enjoy a fatigue-free and comfortable cutting process. Ideal Gift - Our French Series have close to perfect smooth lines. The classic silver-white blade with black handle looks more elegant overall. At the same time, the French pattern on the back of the knife and the handle echo each other, increasing the ornamental nature of the knife. The bull's head engraving at the handle joint is also one of our features. In addition, our elegant chef knife comes with a chic gift box that is a real gift idea. About us - We pay attention to the quality of the product and the customer's experience, so each knife will be strictly inspected before the factory will ensure that customers receive the best products. We ensure our products will meet your expectations. In order to eliminate risks, we will provide each customer with 12 months of warranty and 30 -day unconditional refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v9C7vGv1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huusk","source_asin":"B0C7GWLWFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7GWLWFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7GWLWFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
