window.products.push({"id":700155,"name":"Exclusivo Mezcla Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 2 Pack Queen Size Silky Pillowcases with Envelop Closure, (Silver, 20”X30”)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oM-hFE8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of 100% high quality polyester satin. The satin pillowcase are elegant in texture and smooth to the touch with a silky soft plush. In addition, the satin fabric is much more durable and sturdy than traditional silk fabric. Great for Keeping Hairstyle. The fabric of satin pillowcase is so soft and smooth like silk which could better reduce the friction of your beautiful hairstyle. It is very beneficial to prevent hair breakage. Great for Your Skin: The satin fabric is not only good for hairstyle, but also could effectively reduce the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines. To be compared with cotton fabric, the satin pillowcase is much more comfortable and soft. Accompanied with the stain pillowcases, your sleep quality would be better improved. Envelop Closure Design: Without the zipper, the pillowcase can be also suitable for your pillow with the envelop closure. It is much more convenient to pull in and take out the pillow. Easy to Wash: The satin pillowcase can be machine washable in the cold and delicate wash. It also can be tumble dried in the low temperature. Please do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oM-hFE8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusivo Mezcla","source_asin":"B088D8B3LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088D8B3LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088D8B3LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
