window.products.push({"id":700370,"name":"Bullyland Shire Horse Gelding Action Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rVaG4ctPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Shire horse's coat colors is usually bay and brown. Markings are visible on the head and legs. Markings? do you know about those? if not then let's find out! many horses can be identified by their markings. These are white hair points on the head and legs. These are innate in the horse and do not change as they age. The Shire horse is one of the cold-blooded races. Do you know a lot about horses and what a cold-blood race is? no?! then you will learn it now. The term cold-blooded race has nothing to do with body temperature. It actually refers to the very heavy body of the horse and its calm demeanor. Since they are heavy and have lots of muscles, cold-blooded animals can do hard work. These horses eat plants. They like fresh food, but also eat pressed concentrated food. Typical food items include hay, carrots, fruit, grass, Oats and Barley. They drink up to 40 liters of water per day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rVaG4ctPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bullyland","source_asin":"B000P36U0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000P36U0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000P36U0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700371,"name":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking Mini Fluted Cake Pan, Makes 6 Pieces, Red European-Grade Silicone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SiZiMEw7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mrs. Anderson’s 6-Cup Silicone Fluted Cake Pan makes 6 mini fluted cakes measuring 6.5 x 1.18-inches each. This professional-quality nonstick bakeware creates beautiful baked cakes without the sticky, baked-on mess. Made from 100-percent European-grade silicone, Mrs. Anderson’s specialty bakeware offers the same quick food release and easy cleanup as traditional silicone but is even more flexible and durable to maintain its original shape and non-stick qualities through more uses. Designed with ample support to stand on its own, yet flexible enough to unmold foods with a gentle twist. Subjected to higher standards of testing for a superior food grade silicone, European-grade silicone baking pans maintain their elasticity and flexibility longer, and are stronger and more durable to withstand everyday stress and strain, like twisting to unmold and release foods, yet bounce back to their original shape. Their non-stick property is maintained through more uses than other baking molds in an even wider range of temperatures (-40 to 500-degrees Fahrenheit). Mrs. Anderson’s Silicone Fluted Cake Pan is easy to use. Simply place it on a cookie sheet, pour in batter, and bake according to recipe. Whether learning how to bake or perfecting a family recipe for individual coffee cakes, spice cakes, individual cheesecake rings, or herb and cheesy bread, this nonstick pan offers an amazing baking experience for breakfast, brunch, holiday meals, and entertaining. Safe to use from freezer to oven (-40 to 500-degrees Fahrenheit), microwave, and dishwasher. BPA free. Includes instructions. Flexible and naturally non-stick to release foods with ease. Dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Do not use knives, scrapers, brushes or cutters. Never cut in the pan. Mrs. Anderson's Baking, a go-to brand for the home baker. Brought to you by HIC-Harold Import Company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SiZiMEw7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B098GBHGK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098GBHGK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098GBHGK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
