window.products.push({"id":700403,"name":"AMERICAN PILLOWCASE Oviedo Ultra 100% Cotton 6-Piece Luxury Towel Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ur9xLoWtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have never owned Turkish towels, you are in for a treat. These towels are incredibility soft and continually get softer with each washing. These particular towels were slowly woven on a Jacquard loom which allows for a beautiful, intricate sculpted weave. We have been told they are like \"art on the towel rod\" and \"almost too nice to actually use.\" These towels have never seen nor should you introduce them to bleach. Turkey is the ONLY country which does not use bleach even in the production of its white towels. All towels are VAT dyed (including the white) under intense pressure for many hours to make sure the color gets deep into every fiber of the cotton. This keeps the towels looking bright even after many washings.  These are highly absorbent but neither too heavy nor too light. \"Heavy\" does not make a towel more absorbent. Using great cotton and never using bleach does. Add to Cart now knowing that your satisfaction is 100% Guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ur9xLoWtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN PILLOWCASE","source_asin":"B00JHLBZ7U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JHLBZ7U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JHLBZ7U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
