window.products.push({"id":700485,"name":"Presto 05450 DualDaddy Electric Deep Fryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9GxjbLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fry two different foods at once without intermingling. Large capacity up to 8 servings. Snap on cover lets you store oil in fryer. Removable divider for cooking large pieces of fish. Thermostat automatically keeps oil at the perfect frying temperature. 1500 watts 120 volts, 60 Hz only Amazon.com In the homespun days, food was usually fried in a big cast-iron metal pot. But modern times demand simpler solutions. The Presto DualDaddy electric deep fryer fits on a countertop and is so easy to use. Just add oil, plug it in, and in 15 minutes it's heated up and ready to fry. Its sleek, elliptical black bucket shape matches form to function-- simple and classic. The DualDaddy holds up to eight cups of oil or four pounds of shortening, and it can handle up to eight servings of food at a time, as well as being large enough to accommodate larger pieces of meat or fish. With the divider in, two kinds of food can be frying at the same time with no intermingling of flavors. The internal thermostat keeps the oil at the optimum frying temperature. An accompanying scoop, slotted for draining, is for lifting food in and out or for turning food halfway through the cooking time. The power cord has a magnetic safety connection, so that if the unit is jostled during cooking, the cord will disconnect, shutting power off immediately. After straining the used oil, it can be poured back into the unit and stored, covered by the accompanying snap-on plastic lid. After frying, unplug the unit and allow it to cool completely before attempting to empty oil. Wash the DualDaddy with warm, sudsy water and dry it thoroughly; it is not immersible. To preserve the nonstick finish, inside and out, do not use steel wool or harsh, abrasive cleansers. The Presto DualDaddy measures 9 by 14 by 8-1/2 inches (including handles). Presto guarantees this product with a one-year limited warranty. A simple instruction and recipe sheet is enclosed. --Garland Withers From the Manufacturer The easy way to fry two foods at once! Big capacity fries up to eight cups of food. Special divider keep foods separated, or can be removed to accommodate large pieces of chicken or fish. The perfect frying temperature is automatically maintained, with no controls to set or watch. Heavy-cast aluminum body with nonstick finish, inside and out, for easy cleaning. Snap-on lid allows oil to be stored in the fryer to use again. Slotted scoop included. 1-year limited warranty. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9GxjbLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Presto","source_asin":"B0000DAZ72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DAZ72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DAZ72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
