window.products.push({"id":700579,"name":"Rhomtree Console Table Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet Home Furniture for Entryway Hallway with Doors Shelf (Blue 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8195M-FHnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Highlight your home with this decorative accent cabinet, the fretwork doors add for an elegant design that is attractive and eye-catching. Made of solid pine wood for top and high-grade MDF for framework and legs, the storage cabinet is built for long-lasting construction. With painted finish, the accent cabinet features a simple yet charming look. The shelf is adjustable to store your favorite decor and accessories. This combination of practical and ornamental design create a beautiful accent console cabinet that will complement any living room, dining room or hallway. Specification: Table Materials: Pine + MDF wood Door Material: Tempered glass  Type: Console Tables, Accent Cabinet  Two Shelves Top Weight Capacity: 150 lbs Shelf Weight Capacity: 80lbs Overall measurements：33.8''Wx30.1''Hx14.9''D Clearance to Floor: 3.9\" Weight: 53 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8195M-FHnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhomtree","source_asin":"B07Q4CVSMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q4CVSMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q4CVSMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700580,"name":"YiiMO French Press Coffee Maker, 34 Oz Large Glass Pitcher 4 Level Filter System Café Carafe Teapot plus Stainless Coffee Spoon n Cleaner Brush for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x3J9znOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The YiiMO French Press Coffee Maker allows you to brew a delicious cup of coffee in just 3 minutes. Its portable and steady design makes it perfect for making fresh French coffee, tea, espresso, or cold brew on the go, whether you're at home, on a picnic, in the office, camping, or traveling. The compact size and easy-to-use design make it convenient to carry with you wherever you go. The 34-ounce beaker is made of thick borosilicate glass that can withstand boiling water without the risk of BPA contamination. Unlike metal French presses, this one does not produce loud scratching noises when you press the filter down. The glass beaker also allows you to monitor the brewing process and enjoy the aroma of your freshly brewed coffee. The filter arm effectively separates the hot water and coffee grounds as you press it, providing a smooth and flavorful cup of coffee. 4-level filtration system that uses a 4-layered 304 stainless steel double filter screen captures even the smallest coffee grounds. This helps to extract the full flavor and aroma of your coffee without being affected by a paper filter. The filter screen is easy to disassemble and clean, and you can stack multiple screens together to refine the taste of your espresso even further. This professional-grade filtration system ensures that you can enjoy a cup of pure, delicious coffee every time. Precision and Stability - It features an exact scale line that allows you to prepare the right amount of coffee or tea to meet your needs. The frame is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel to prevent corrosion and rust, so you don't have to worry about damaging the press. This durable and reliable design ensures that you can enjoy a perfect cup of coffee every time. Cmfortable Handle - is durable & sturdy, clever design for free flowing & effortless pouring to your mug.The coffee spoon and cleaning brush are extra gifts for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x3J9znOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YiiMO","source_asin":"B0969N54Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0969N54Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0969N54Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
