window.products.push({"id":700724,"name":"SYLVIA'S SHOP Vintage 4x6 Picture Frame, Antique Ornate Photo Frame, Table Top Display and Wall Hanging Home Decor, Old Fashioned Gorgeous Photo Galle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rUEK97XjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN: The antique navy blue picture frame 4x6 with artistic Victorian embellishment perfectly showcases your favorite pictures, portrait or art prints. Fits great for any older family photos. It appears aged and antique. The vintage picture frame 4 by 6 is an ideal choice to display your precious memories in your life, and brings extra old-world charm to your home. EXCELENT QUALITY: The antique looking picture frame is sturdy and well made. It is heavy duty of great value. The lovely retro frame is made of environmental resin, including black velvet backing. The frame comes with a solid easel back for table top display and hooks for the option to hang on the wall. Real glass front gives a clear view of your picture and preserves the life of your photo. ATTRACTIVE LOOK: The beautiful frame is hand crafted in gorgeous navy blue and bronze gold colors. It looks warm and appealing. Special vintage appearance with perfect details. Outline border dimensions are 6x8 inch and made to display a 4x6 inch photo. It will light your home and make your room look more like a work of art. TABLETOP DISPLAY AND WALL DECOR: This timeless and classy picture frame 4”x6” stands up either portrait or landscape wonderfully, and really dresses up the table. It also hangs up either horizontally or vertically, adds a sense of luxury to a gallery wall. This unique frame looks great in the living room, kitchen, dining room. It can be placed just about anywhere, from your home to your office, studio or gallery. IDEAL GIFTS: The ornate old fashioned picture frame is a perfect gift for your family, friends, relatives, and someone you love. Makes a great gift idea for multiple occasions: wedding, anniversary, housewarming, birthday, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, baby showers, Christmas and family events. This fancy frame delightfully combines sentimental value, practical use, and decorative splendor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rUEK97XjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYLVIA'S SHOP","source_asin":"B09ZYRH4L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYRH4L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYRH4L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700725,"name":"United States Coast Guard 2 in 1 Ribbon Magnet, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819u72GPguL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Magnet America's United States Coast Guard 2 in 1 Ribbon Magnet is a great way to show your support by placing the magnet in one of the most highly visible public spaces, the back end of your car!! This magnet measures 3.875\" x 8\" is made from high quality 30 mil (.03\") magnetic material with bright vibrant colors. One ribbon arm of the magnet is printed with the American flag with \"Coast Guard\" emblazoned in strong bold print on the other. Show your pride of putting your life on the line for our great Country. Honor your friends or family that served. The 2 1/4\" x 2\" center piece featuring the Coast Guard Emblem is removable and looks great centered above a tailgate handle or on the fridge of anyone who has a Coast Guardsman in their life. The Magnet America's USCG 2 in 1 Ribbon Magnet is officially licensed by the Coast Guard and is proudly American Made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819u72GPguL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ramsons Imports","source_asin":"B07LGDGGVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LGDGGVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LGDGGVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
