window.products.push({"id":700786,"name":"Almcmy Frying Pan Set, 2 Piece Professional Nonstick Skillet, 8 Inch & 10 Inch PFOA-Free Cookware for Electric & Gas Stoves Use, Dishwasher Safe - Sen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DD0OU9Z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Piece Professional Frying Pan】The set includes an 8inch and a 10inch wide aluminum frying pan, two different sizes of frying pans can meet your needs to cook different foods at the same time, you don't have to spend too long on cooking because there are not enough frying pans. A quality and thick aluminum frying pan that will stand the test of time, is PFOA-free, and use it for extended periods of time without any problems, and it will be a great aid to your cooking. 【Double Layer Non-stick Coating】The frying pan is equipped with a double-layer black non-stick coating, which can effectively prevent the food from sticking to the frying pan during the cooking process. Will not cause any impact on food, to ensure the health of you and your family, so you can use it with confidence. Note: Do not rub the frying pan vigorously with the stainless steel cleaning ball to avoid damaging the coating. 【Induction Base】Each frying pan in the frying pan set comes with an induction base, the induction base for even heating ensures a stable distribution of heat, and it is compatible with gas, ceramic, electric, and induction cooktops to ensure the perfect presentation of every meal. In case of need, you can even remove the handle and put the frying pan in the oven for use, which will not cause any damage to the frying pan and is an excellent choice for you to try different cooking methods. 【Easy to Clean】After using the frying pan, you can rinse the frying pan directly in water, or put it in the dishwasher. The firm and stable structure will prevent the frying pan from being damaged or deformed in the dishwasher, and there is no need to worry about causing the coating is damaged. Plus, you can hang your frying pan on the wall without taking up any extra desk space, keeping your kitchen neat and tidy at all times. 【Easily cook a variety of Foods】Whether it's sautéing vegetables, frying steaks, hamburgers, simmering sauces or other dishes, this frying pan is perfect for use, and its beautiful appearance will make it an eye-catching presence in your kitchen. If you encounter problems during your use, you can tell us, and the high-quality customer service will provide you with a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DD0OU9Z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Almcmy","source_asin":"B0BGKGW783","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGKGW783","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGKGW783","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
