window.products.push({"id":700811,"name":"Silverware Set, 60-Piece Silverware Set for 12, Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set, Spoons and Forks Set Suitable for Home/ Restaurant, Mirror Polis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718gqF2ppdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Silverware Set for 12 People】Includes 12 dinner forks, 12 salad forks, 12 dinner knives, 12 dinner spoons and 12 teaspoons, essential for families or restaurants. Whether it is daily family dinners, gatherings, or operating a restaurant, it is an irreplaceable value-for-money choice. 【High-Quality & Dishwasher Safe】This flatware set is made of premium stainless steel, which is very durable, rust-proof and anti-corrosion, and it is not easily deformed or be scratched. It's commendable that it leaves no residual metallic odor when you have your meal. It's worth mentioning that it can be cleaned in the dishwasher, so just save your labor. 【Classical Design & Comfortable Handle】The cutlery set is designed with a classic shape, and the exquisite polishing process makes the edges of the flatware smooth without rough spots. The moderate length and weight will bring you a more comfortable holding experience. In addition, the classic shape design allows the utensils to be easily matched with your existing tableware, please rest assured to choose Funnydin. 【Perfect for Use】Our flatware set for 12 people are ideal for family daily use, gatherings, family dinners, wedding and other formal occasions. Also apply to camping, hotel, restaurant, bistro, etc or when you need extra knives, forks and spoons set. 【Funnydin’s Promise】Funnydin's business philosophy is to provide customers with a satisfactory shopping experience with high-quality silverware set and cheap prices. If you have any dissatisfaction, please feel free to contact us. We are looking forward to your feedback and make improvements immediately. We promise to give a 100% refund for dissatisfaction. Please enjoy the Non-risk purchase of Funnydin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718gqF2ppdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funnydin","source_asin":"B09FL9RB99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FL9RB99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FL9RB99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700812,"name":"Pluto Produkter Bird Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cBLWrSJ6L._AC_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the birds and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this birds candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candle holders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candleholders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn't disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candle holders should be such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cBLWrSJ6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B004RNBQUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004RNBQUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004RNBQUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":700813,"name":"Artificial Hydrangea in Small Black Cube Ceramic (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZLamkEjL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This artificial hydrangea arrangement will add color and life to any spot in your home or office. The hydrangeas are securely \"potted\" in a contemporary gloss black ceramic cube measuring 5\" x 5\" x 5\" tall. The overall dimensions are measured flower tip to leaf tip, base of vase to tallest flower tip: 8\" tall X 8 1/2\" square. Measurements are approximate, and will be determined by your final shaping of the plant upon unpacking it. No arranging is necessary, only minor shaping, with the way in which we package and ship our products. This product is only recommended for indoor use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZLamkEjL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House of Silk Flowers","source_asin":"B017WGF6TY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-700813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017WGF6TY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017WGF6TY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
